# Large binary artifacts — never commit these to git (exceeds GitHub's 100 MB
# per-file limit). They are re-downloadable from the sources in README.md:
#   vendor/OptiScaler-NR-v0.8.3-rtx40-mfg.zip  -> the fork's release page
#   vendor/nvngx_dlssnr.dll                    -> ShortFuse's pinned RenoDX thread
#
# Options:
#   1. Leave them untracked (this file). Re-download or scp them in to run.
#   2. If you want them versioned, install Git LFS and track them instead:
#        git lfs track "vendor/*.zip" "vendor/*.dll"
#      then remove these entries and commit the .gitattributes.

vendor/*.zip
vendor/*.dll

# Large binary artifacts — never commit these to git (exceeds GitHub's 100 MB
